==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} The [[continuous]] [[system]] involved in the [[production]] and [[excretion]] of [[urine]]; the [[kidney]]s, [[ureter]]s, [[urinary bladder]] and [[urethra]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|urinary system}}

====Meronyms====
{{qualifier|[[nephrourologic]] segments of the urinary tract, in [[streamwise]] order:}}
* {{l|en|kidney}}, {{l|en|renal pelvis}}, {{l|en|ureter}}, {{l|en|urinary bladder}}, {{l|en|urethra}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|urinary tract infection}}, {{l|en|UTI}}

